tem-b\"></span>\n    <span class=\"base\"></span>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"translation\">\n    <h1 class=\"translation-title\">【译文】</h1>\n    <p class=\"translation-text\">\n      马克用他的退休金在海岸边租了一间住所，每年都去那儿欣赏海的美<br>\n      深处那生动的美丽。<br>\n      有一次，马克带着他的水下望远镜和手电筒，潜到陡峭的暗礁和海草保<br>\n      护区间的分界线。突然，一只长着尖利牙齿使人畏惧的捕食物出现在他对面。<br>\n      马克吓坏了，但是很快，他就意识到，他不是攻击的目标。这只灰色海豹的<br>\n      唇上有道整齐的伤口，还有不时地被潮水冲得头上脚下。尽管如此，<br>\n      它却总是努力轻轻碰撞马克，似乎在催促他帮助它。于是马克放弃了逃跑。<br>\n      在这只海豹的合作下，马克用一张网把它拖到浅水区并毫不迟疑给它动了一<br>\n      个简单的手术，帮助它解决了问题，然后将它安置在海边一个狭窄的洞里。<br>\n      每次当马克给它带来鲜美可口的鱼时，它就会高兴地尽可能叫唤、还吮吸他的<br>\n      手。目击者都说它们的秩序映射出人与动物关系中奇妙的一个方面。\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"exercise\">\n    <h2 class=\"exercise-title\">【单词语境练习】</h2>\n    <p class=\"practice\">\n      <span class=\"practice-line indent\">Mark rented an<span class=\"blank b66\"></span> <span class=\"meaning\">（住所）</span> with his<span class=\"blank b55\"></span> <span class=\"meaning\">（退休金）</span> near the<span class=\"blank b30\"></span> <span class=\"meaning\">（海</span></span>\n      <span class=\"practice-line\"><span class=\"meaning\">岸）</span>.He paid annual visits there to enjoy the<span class=\"blank b45\"></span> <span class=\"meaning\">（生动的）</span> beauty in the<span class=\"blank b35\"></span></span>\n      <span class=\"practice-line indent-small\"><span class=\"meaning\">（深处）</span> of the<span class=\"blank b45\"></span> <span class=\"meaning\">（纯净的）</span> sea.</span>\n\n      <span class=\"practice-line indent\" style=\"margin-top:1px;\">Once, with his underwater<span class=\"blank b55\"></span> <span class=\"meaning\">（望远镜）</span> and<span class=\"blank b55\"></span> <span class=\"meaning\">（手电筒)</span>,Mark <span class=\"blank b35\"></span></span>\n      <span class=\"practice-line\"><span class=\"meaning\">（潜)</span>along the<span class=\"blank b45\"></span><span class=\"meaning\">（分界线）</span> between the<span class=\"blank b72\"></span> <span class=\"meaning\">（陡峭的）</span> reef an