d it out after a simple operation</span>\n      <span class=\"practice-line\">and settled it in a<span class=\"blank b60\"></span><span class=\"meaning\">（狭窄的）</span> cave by the<span class=\"blank b55\"></span><span class=\"meaning\">（海边）</span>. Every time he</span>\n      <span class=\"practice-line\">brought it<span class=\"blank b55\"></span><span class=\"meaning\">（可口的）</span> fish it would<span class=\"blank b60\"></span><span class=\"meaning\">（叫唤）</span>and<span class=\"blank b45\"></span><span class=\"meaning\">（吮吸）</span>his hands</span>\n      <span class=\"practice-line\">happily.<span class=\"blank b60\"></span><span class=\"meaning\">（目击者）</span>said their<span class=\"blank b50\"></span><span class=\"meaning\">（秩序）</span>reflected a magic<span class=\"blank b45\"></span><span class=\"meaning\">（方面）</span>of</span>\n      <span class=\"practice-line\">the<span class=\"blank b66\"></span><span class=\"meaning\">（关系）</span> between humans and animals.</span>\n    </p>\n  </section>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
